          "label": "10% proposed cap on banked + capital improvement increases",
          "value": "Proposed: combined banked and capital improvement increases on rent-controlled units limited to 10% per year for the next three years",
          "status": "verified",
          "source_ids": [
            "S72",
            "S71"
          ],
          "notes": "SF.gov notice posted November 9, 2026 on the rent-increase page (S01) and the Current Rates page (S02).",
